          "items": [
            "Family Ties by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Beachfront! And a private pool?! Believe! Welcome to Family Ties, a 30A jackpot with gulf views, salty breezes, and a front-row seat to the waves. This Old Seagrove retreat puts you right on the sand, with Seaside’s charming shops and restaurants just a breezy bike ride away.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Beachfront on Seagrove Beach!<br>🏖️ Gorgeous deck leads directly to beach<br>👙 Private pool<br>🛌 4 bedrooms, 4 baths<br>🚲 4 bikes. Explore Seaside and Seagrove!<br>🚿 Outdoor shower<br>🍤 Gas grill<br>🦞 Great dining!<br>🛍️ Shops, boutiques, eateries<br><br>The sunroom and outdoor lounge are made for unwinding, whether it’s morning coffee with a view or dinner with a backdrop that steals the show.<br><br>The kitchen, dining, and living areas serve up more of those stunning Gulf views, along with plenty of space to relax.<br>Just off the living room, two bedrooms feature more incredible views. A guest room with two twin beds, and a gorgeous primary suite.<br><br>Down the hall, a cozy sitting room, with a pull-out sleeper sofa and a bathroom, leads out to the spacious pool area. There’s also another guest room, with 2 twins, and lastly, a second, plush primary bedroom. Enjoy!<br><br>At Oversee 30A, we do vacation right. A spotless home, a seamless stay, and a local team always nearby. Our office is just down the road, open daily, with 24/7 support whenever you need us.<br><br>Have a large family? Consider booking \"Ethridge House\" at 67 Montgomery Street as well! Reserving both houses guarantees exclusive access to the private beach, only thirty steps away.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- Beachfront<br>- Private pool<br>- 4 bedrooms, 4 baths<br>- 2008 sq ft<br>- Propane grill <br>- Wi-Fi<br>- 4 bikes included<br>- Parking is limited to 4 vehicles<br>- Outdoor shower has hot and cold water<br>- No on-street parking<br> <br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bath, TV<br>- Guest Room: 2 twins, TV<br>- Pull-out sofa in sitting room, private bath, TV<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bath, TV<br>- Guest Room: 2 twins, shared hall bath, TV<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
